    <!--
        List of ALL packages which support AudioGameEffect.
        Each package has AudioGameEffect parameters for headset and/or speaker.
        For param item, four numbers represent: [FpsOpLowFreqBoost]-[FpsOpVocalBoost]-[FpsOpFootStepBoost]-[FpsOpSoundFieldBoost].
        [0, 100] represents the degree of voice enhancement (effectLevel)
        The third number represents gameType: 1 for FPS/shooting games, 2 for music/other games
    -->

